  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "<kind>.json and site/<kind>-vN.json: the data beside a document, written by code from what the builders sent\n(J2 `_save_artifact_data`). `schema` is checked and not stored (a field of that name would need an alias that is not a\nPython keyword, design rule 7); `to_json()` puts it back. Each section is checked as the library model of that section.",
